      "status": "directional_but_not_confirmed",
      "text": "At 1.0 s history, small-to-large Transformer scaling changed rollout-macro NLL by 0.000413 in the preregistered direction, but the tier ordering was non-monotonic and the Holm-adjusted p value was 0.364. The data therefore do not support a strong capacity-limitation explanation."
