          "artifact": "offline_synthesis.json",
          "field": "three_axes.primary_contrasts[H3]",
          "unit": "NLL per step"
        }
      ],
      "status": "generic_encoder_advantage_not_attention_specific",
      "text": "The matched Transformer reduced NLL relative to the MLP at both 0.0 s (0.007006) and 1.0 s (0.006708). However, its history gain was not larger (difference-in-differences -0.000298, 95% interval -0.001411 to 0.000620), so the evidence supports a bounded encoder-family advantage, not an attention-specific extraction advantage."
    },
