      "status": "no_demonstrated_physical_moderation",
      "text": "The model-by-risk interaction was -0.313 s for completion time and 0.027 m for minimum separation; both paired-group intervals crossed zero. P* improved in-loop top-1 ADE under fixed-medium risk by 0.037 m, but this predictive difference did not produce a demonstrated change in the co-primary physical outcomes."
